    "type": "text",
    "text": "\"This ICE operation will target the criminal illegal aliens who flocked to Chicago and Illinois because they knew Governor [JB] Pritzker and his sanctuary policies would protect them and allow them to roam free on American streets,\" the DHS said earlier this month. ",
